+================================================================================
+
+This software is a modified version of dsh-ide-git 0.15.0.
+
+  Upstream   dsh-ide-git
+  Copyright  Copyright (c) 2026 KannaKuron
+  License    MIT
+  Source     https://github.com/KannaKuron/dsh-ide-git
+  Baseline   https://registry.npmjs.org/dsh-ide-git/-/dsh-ide-git-0.15.0.tgz
+
+  Fork       dsh-wsl-git
